 Iman Developers. The apartments are available in studio to 4-bedroom configurations"},"more_info":[{"id":2616,"answer":"<p>The initial down payment required is 20% of the total unit price. The remaining balance is structured as follows:<br>10% due in 90 days<br>10% upon 20% construction completion<br>10% upon 40% construction completion<br>10% upon 60% construction completion<br>The final 40% is due upon project completion.</p>","question":"What is the One Sky Park payment plan?"},{"id":2617,"answer":"<p>The expected completion date for One Sky Park is Q4 2027.</p>","question":"When is the expected completion date for One Sky Park?"},{"id":2618,"answer":"<p>In addition to the installment payments, there may be standard charges such as Dubai Land Department (DLD) fees and other administrative fees, which should be considered when planning your budget.</p>","question":"Are there any additional costs during the payment plan?"},{"id":2619,"answer":"<p>One Sky Park offers a variety of floor plans, including studios, 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom penthouses.</p>","question":"What types of floor plans are available at One Sky Park?"},{"id":2620,"answer":"<p>The sizes of the units vary depending on the type:<br>Studios range from 414 to 521 sq. ft.<br>1-bedroom apartments range from 680 to 736 sq. ft.<br>2-bedroom apartments range from 980 to 1,216 sq. ft.<br>3-bedroom apartments range from 1,391 to 1,700 sq. ft.<br>3-bedroom penthouses range from 2,300 to 4,050 sq. ft.<br>4-bedroom penthouses are approximately 2,900 to 3,000 sq. ft.</p>","question":"What is the size range of the units at One Sky Park?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":null,"src_cftle":"i/Location_3ed6440afa.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/Location_3ed6440afa.webp","format":"webp","transform":